      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسوّخ</span></b>  <i>He fell into a place rendered very
slimy by rain;</i> (L, K;) or <i>into mud rendered
very watery by rain;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تزوّخ</span>. (L.)

